window.products.push({"id":154322,"name":"Awak Farm Chicken Magnet Rooster Hen Dishwasher Cover,Farmhouse Sunflower Refrigerator Magnetic Kitchen Decor,Vintage Fridge Magnets Decal,Home Applia","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":32.85,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TZgcFE1PL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"When your dishwasher, that you use just about every day is old or outdated.Just looking to give your appliance a facelift?Our Dishwasher Cover can give you the look you want without the hard work or hefty price tag. Feature: + Heat resistant: +Waterproof + +Scratch, and Tear Resistant With a smooth surface that is environmentally safe, easy to remove with no sticky residue. You can do DIY splicing. Quick and economically alternative to old cover. Dishwasher Covers Size: S - 23 W x 17 H inches;58.5Wx 43H cm M - 23 W x 26 H inches;58.5Wx 66 H cm EASY INSTALLATION:Peel it! Stick it! Love it! Simply stick our smudge-proof and fingerprint resistant stainless steel dishwasher panel on the front face of your dishwasher.You can use on your dishwasher as well as on the refrigerator, washing machine, dryer, and many other appliances!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TZgcFE1PL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Awak","source_asin":"B098295SXH","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-154322","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098295SXH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B098295SXH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":154323,"name":"Manastin 3.2 Cu. Ft Mini Fridge with Freezer for Bedroom, Dorm, Office, Energy Star Compact Refrigerator with Adjustbale Thermostat, Removable Glass S","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":109.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vSkgs2gvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Efficient Use of Space】The size of this mini refrigerator is 17.52\" x 19.3\" x 32.7\", with an area of only 7.7ft³, allowing more possibilities for space. With a huge storage space of 3.2 Cu. Ft. and fine partitioning, the upper layer of quick-freezing and efficient refrigeration ensures the freshness of ingredients, while the lower layer of high moisture retention locks in the moisture and nutrition of food. Additional door storage shelves can accommodate a variety of beer drinks and sauces. 【Energy Saving & Low Noise】 This mini fridge is Energy Star certified and consumes only 220kWh of electricity a year, which costs only $0.07 per day, making it environmentally friendly and economical. The compressor works with very low noise, even if placed next to the bed, it will not affect you and your family's sleep, making it a very ideal household appliance. 【Suitable for Various Use Needs】 The humanized reversible single door design can be set to open the door to the left or right according to different space needs and hand habits, making it very convenient to access food. Adjustable feet easily adapt to a variety of uneven ground. Fashionable and simple appearance can be matched with a variety of styles, ideal for use in the bedroom, apartment, dormitory, office 【Adjustable temperature & Defrost】 There are 7 levels available for adjustment, the temperature range from 23℉ to 50℉(-5-10°C), you can easily and quickly adjust the temperature to the desired level. Generally speaking, 4 is suitable for home or office use. Even in the hot summer, you can always enjoy a cold drink. If you have a need for defrosting, you can easily do it by simply pressing the switch in the center of the knob. 【Crisper Drawer & Removable Shelf】 This mini fridge is equipped with 1 crisper drawer, 2 removable shelves and a can rack. The crisper drawer can perfectly accommodate all kinds of vegetables and fruits, and the shelf that can be adjusted in position at will gives more possibilities for internal storage space and makes your refrigerator more neat and tidy. The shelves made of tempered glass are more durable and beautiful than ordinary plastic, easy to scrub, and more secure for food safety. 【Reliable Customer Service】 We are more than willing to take responsibility for your purchase, so if you have any questions, please feel free to contact us. Our customer service team will get back to you within 24 hours. CONTACT US: Login to your amazon account > choose \"Your orders\" > find the order ID > click \"Contact seller\". Satisfying our customers is our constant goal. 【Note】 For your better using experience and longer service life of the refrigerator, we suggest that after receiving the new refrigerator, it is better to let it rest for at least 6 hours and wait for the oil of the compressor to reset before powering on and using it. Don't feel anxious about not cooling down in a short time, you can experience the icy feeling within three hours after plugging in.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81vSkgs2gvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Manastin","source_asin":"B0C4FG62B8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-154323","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4FG62B8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4FG62B8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
