window.products.push({"id":154817,"name":"Ice Makers Countertop, 33lbs/24H, 9 Ice Cubes Ready in 7-8 Mins, Self-Cleaning Portable Ice Making with Scoop and Basket, L&S Bullet-Shaped for Making","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613AbhBGoPL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"🧊【FAST AND EFFICIENT BULLET ICE】Equipped with updated R600a high-quality compressor, it only takes average 7-8 minutes to make 9 bullet-shaped ice cubes when operation. Just fill 8 cups of water into the water tank (2.1L) and choose the bullet size (S & L) you want(L in default); enjoy cold drinks in mins; maximum ice capacity can reach 33 pounds per 24 hours. 🧊【PORTABLE AND UPDATED DESIGN】 Get ice whenever you need it. With the compact size of 9.84*14.76*12.40”, WANAI countertop ice maker is suitable for most counter-tops and easy to move and store. With its STAINLESS STEEL housing design, WANAI ice maker is a modern appliance for bar, RV, party, kitchen and office, etc. 🧊【L & S BULLET SHAPED ICE】 The ice machine can make two different sizes of bullet shaped ice cubes. Large ice cubes are not easy to melt and small ice cubes (hold power button 5s to switch)are ideal to cool drinks quickly. Bullet-shaped ice cubes won't stick together and are perfect for whisky, cold drinks, frozen sea food or first aid in emergency. 🧊【SUPERIOR MATERIAL & SMART OPERATION】 Made from food grade stainless steel and PP materials, our ice maker can offer higher quality ice for you, ensuring your dietary safety. WANAI ice machine has the most advanced infrared sensor technology - ice full & add water function. The countertop ice maker is very easy to clean with its self-cleaning and bottom hole function for draining. It is perfect for home office and easy to maintain. 🧊【WARRANTY SERVICE】Thanks for choosing WANAI and trust in WANAI. All WANAI products provide 1-year warranty and 30-day free return policy. Our customer service is online 24 hours, and we are dedicated to solving every after-sales problem for you. Note: Please put the ice maker upright for at least 24 hours before first using it and place it far from other kitchen appliance.(the compressor needs still and open space storage).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/613AbhBGoPL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WANAI","source_asin":"B0BS8GP1XN","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-154817","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BS8GP1XN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BS8GP1XN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
