window.products.push({"id":154982,"name":"4FT Stainless Steel Washer Hoses with 90 Degree Elbows by Beaquicy - 2 Pack No-Lead Burst Proof Hot & Cold Water Connection Inlet Washer Supply Lines","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NbYlyfaBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤ 𝟏𝟎 𝒀𝑬𝑨𝑹𝑺 𝑾𝑨𝑹𝑹𝑨𝑵𝑻𝒀 ---𝑺𝑼𝑷𝑷𝑶𝑹𝑻𝑺 𝟏𝟎 𝒀𝑬𝑨𝑹𝑺 𝑹𝑬𝑻𝑼𝑹𝑵 𝑨𝑵𝑫 𝑬𝑿𝑪𝑯𝑨𝑵𝑮𝑬.Beaquicy attaches great importance to the shopping experience of each customer.Customer satisfaction is our tireless pursuit. ✦【What You Get】---Each package includes two washing machine hoses, 1 x Blue colored washer hose for cold Water, 1 x Red colored washer hose for hot water. washing machine hoses are color-coded to ensure easy matching of hot-to-hot and cold-to-cold from the water supply faucet to the washing machine. 4 FT stainless steel washer hose with a 90 degree elbow will work from 15° F - 158° F can be used in both high and low temperature environments. ✦【Safety and Durable】---Stainless Steel Washer Supply Hose 4 Ft use true 304 stainless steel for braided outer protective cover , can effective protection against rust and leaking. washer hose 4ft has a 3/4-inch female hose thread connection, and the laundry hoses are equipped with 90-degree elbows on one end for an easy and smooth installation in tight spaces. braided washer machine hoses fit for almost all washers. ✦【100% Brand New and High Quality】---The washing machine hoses 4ft 2 pack are made with Lead free, Pvc core, Extra-thick Rubber washer, 100% pure rubber internal hose, ultra-high tensile strength braided stainless steel hoses, which can preventing water leaks kinking crimping and corrosion.Washing machine hot and cold water hoses can be easily connected to the ordinary household water supply line in the laundry room and solve the housework of laundry. ✦【Easy to Install】---Unplug the washing machine and turn off the water supply before making any repairs.First remove the old washer water lines from the water supply faucet, and screw the new stainless steel washing machine hose to the water supply faucet.Then find the hot and cold water inlets on the washer, and hand-tighten the other end of the new water inlet hose to the corresponding water inlet of the washer.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81NbYlyfaBL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Beaquicy","source_asin":"B0BWMX66JF","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-154982","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWMX66JF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Appliances.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWMX66JF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
